<p>An excerpt from the Object Classes page:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Keter objects fall into one of two categories: those that are of immense strategic value once controlled, or those that have been deemed impossible to destroy due to the nature of the artifact.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'll agree with you that most Keter-class objects are usually those that either can't be contained or if contained, pose a threat to the continued survival of the human race (or the planet/universe/existence etc.), but I'd say this one falls squarely in the first category outlined above. If we could harness this or if it fell into the hands of another organization, it could potentially shift the balance of power by a landslide.</p>

